WEBVTT

01:43.000 --> 01:44.560
They're usually running their businesses

01:44.800 --> 01:45.920
and never get to dress up.

01:46.360 --> 01:47.800
Once we give them a proper makeover,

01:48.160 --> 01:49.400
it'll be a big change.

01:49.800 --> 01:50.400
Then

01:50.640 --> 01:52.840
we can put the

01:53.240 --> 01:54.600
before-and-after shots

01:54.920 --> 01:56.039
together for contrast.

01:57.520 --> 01:58.720
The photos speak for themselves.

01:59.080 --> 02:00.000
Customers will come flooding in.

02:00.880 --> 02:02.120
Our slogan will be

02:02.440 --> 02:04.480
"Director Li works her magic,

02:04.720 --> 02:06.680
middle-aged women in Zhazhating shine again".

02:06.960 --> 02:07.560
How's that?

02:07.760 --> 02:08.479
Remember it for me.

02:09.320 --> 02:10.320
Okay. That one is good.

02:13.440 --> 02:14.120
What about you?

02:14.720 --> 02:15.760
You really won't model for us?

02:17.760 --> 02:18.840
Why do you keep asking me?

02:19.200 --> 02:20.200
Kyle and Big G can do it too.

02:20.520 --> 02:21.400
You're handsome.

02:29.480 --> 02:30.200
Thanks.

02:31.280 --> 02:32.079
You've got good taste.

02:35.800 --> 02:36.800
Suit yourself.

02:37.680 --> 02:38.880
I've given them my word

02:38.920 --> 02:39.960
they will look

02:40.000 --> 02:41.200
amazing on camera.

02:43.480 --> 02:44.720
Oh right, who's the photographer?

02:45.400 --> 02:45.920
Quanya.

02:46.600 --> 02:47.400
Quanya?

02:47.680 --> 02:48.560
Can he handle it?

02:50.079 --> 02:51.600
Of course.

02:55.440 --> 02:56.040
I can't do it.

02:57.200 --> 02:58.560
You can't or are you just scared?

02:58.600 --> 02:59.160
Both.

03:00.000 --> 03:01.040
How will you know if you never try?

03:01.360 --> 03:02.040
You take pictures

03:02.040 --> 03:03.000
all the time, don't you?

03:03.680 --> 03:05.040
I just shoot for fun.

03:05.120 --> 03:05.960
Not good enough

03:06.440 --> 03:07.280
for a real shoot.

03:07.360 --> 03:08.840
You call this not good enough?

03:09.280 --> 03:09.880
Look at this.

03:10.360 --> 03:10.960
The landscape.

03:11.200 --> 03:12.200
It's breathtaking.

03:12.200 --> 03:13.320
The scenery is beautiful.

03:13.560 --> 03:14.480
The portrait looks nice too.

03:14.560 --> 03:15.560
That's because Han's pretty.

03:17.840 --> 03:19.280
Stop putting yourself down like that.

03:22.160 --> 03:22.960
Professional

03:23.240 --> 03:24.160
work isn't that simple.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.000
Those references

03:25.000 --> 03:26.000
Ye sent me

03:26.040 --> 03:27.640
were all shot by commercial photographers.

03:28.040 --> 03:28.960
I'm just an amateur.

03:29.160 --> 03:30.640
Even if I wanna have a try,

03:30.800 --> 03:31.800
I don't have the equipment.

03:31.880 --> 03:32.640
Who says you don't?

03:39.800 --> 03:40.760
Where'd you get a DSLR?

03:41.880 --> 03:42.640
What if I said

03:43.160 --> 03:43.720
I bought it?

03:43.760 --> 03:44.880
Wu, are you crazy?

03:45.680 --> 03:46.200
You bought such

03:46.200 --> 03:47.079
an expensive camera?

03:47.640 --> 03:48.360
That's not the point.

03:49.520 --> 03:50.079
Give it a try.

03:52.480 --> 03:53.040
Alright.

04:02.360 --> 04:02.920
Ye,

04:04.360 --> 04:05.440
I've found all the perm rods.

04:07.000 --> 04:07.920
I've been thinking.

04:08.200 --> 04:09.120
Advertising

04:09.200 --> 04:10.760
gets customers in the door,

04:10.960 --> 04:12.200
but skill is what keeps

04:12.480 --> 04:14.120
them coming back.

04:14.360 --> 04:15.280
However,

04:15.320 --> 04:16.720
Xuan Island keeps doing

04:16.800 --> 04:18.079
the same few hairstyles,

04:18.160 --> 04:19.200
with no changes.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.320
How can we attract new customers

04:20.320 --> 04:21.480
or make more money?

04:21.640 --> 04:22.480
If we can

04:23.080 --> 04:24.440
figure out these styles

04:24.640 --> 04:25.800
and roll out several hit looks,

04:26.480 --> 04:27.880
customers will come, and we can

04:27.880 --> 04:28.600
charge more.

04:29.040 --> 04:30.200
But I don't know how to do

04:30.360 --> 04:31.280
any of these.

04:31.640 --> 04:32.440
Then learn.

04:33.000 --> 04:34.800
Just follow along step by step.

04:35.000 --> 04:37.040
It's just curling hair, right?

04:38.280 --> 04:39.000
It's fine.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.040
No harm in picking up a new skill.

04:40.159 --> 04:41.040
If it doesn't work out, no loss.

04:41.200 --> 04:42.080
If it does, it's a big win.

04:43.120 --> 04:43.600
Come on.

04:43.640 --> 04:44.240
That's right.

04:44.840 --> 04:45.360
So

04:45.800 --> 04:46.320
how do I learn?

04:46.600 --> 04:47.200
Who do I learn from?

04:47.920 --> 04:49.080
Online tutorials.

04:49.360 --> 04:51.120
We'll figure it out together.

04:51.560 --> 04:52.040
Okay.

04:59.200 --> 04:59.840
Lanfang,

05:00.520 --> 05:02.200
can you give me a hair gloss tonight?

05:02.640 --> 05:03.560
I haven't had

05:03.560 --> 05:04.760
photos taken in years.

05:04.960 --> 05:05.920
No problem.

05:06.040 --> 05:07.400
I must look perfect.

05:07.520 --> 05:08.520
You should get yours done too.

05:09.120 --> 05:11.240
A gloss won't do much for my hair.

05:11.240 --> 05:13.320
Then get a perm.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.680
Make mine big and curly.

05:14.720 --> 05:15.880
You think that'll look good?

05:15.960 --> 05:16.800
Oh my god.

05:21.960 --> 05:22.840
Nian?

05:23.080 --> 05:23.640
Lanfang,

05:24.440 --> 05:25.160
how do I look?

05:27.280 --> 05:29.360
Did a bomb go off on your head?

05:30.880 --> 05:32.560
This looks wild.

05:36.920 --> 05:37.680
Doesn't it look good?

05:47.960 --> 05:48.680
Let me see

05:48.760 --> 05:49.720
what kind of perm you want.

05:54.040 --> 05:54.960
You want this kind?

05:55.200 --> 05:56.320
Yeah, that's what we want.

05:56.600 --> 05:57.000
But...

05:57.520 --> 05:58.560
Your rollers

05:58.560 --> 06:00.000
are way too big.

06:00.640 --> 06:03.120
This style is called a wool perm.

06:03.440 --> 06:04.800
It's for guys

06:04.960 --> 06:06.480
with fine, thin hair.

06:06.960 --> 06:08.880
You need small rollers

06:09.040 --> 06:10.840
and proper cold perm solution.

06:11.000 --> 06:12.080
And you have to get the timing just right.

06:12.840 --> 06:15.480
Your curl came out fine,

06:15.840 --> 06:17.160
but it doesn't suit you.

06:19.120 --> 06:20.600
Auntie, what do we do?

06:22.480 --> 06:23.280
Leave it to me.

06:24.840 --> 06:25.960
You're cutting his hair?

06:26.280 --> 06:28.280
I already cut the back short.

06:29.280 --> 06:30.760
It's fried.

06:31.640 --> 06:32.280
I'll just

06:32.880 --> 06:33.760
trim it up.

06:35.400 --> 06:36.000
Auntie,

06:36.760 --> 06:38.560
do you know how to do these styles?

06:40.560 --> 06:42.159
I've seen enough to know

06:42.159 --> 06:44.040
how to do them myself.

06:44.280 --> 06:46.480
There are many kinds of perms,

06:46.600 --> 06:48.720
such as foil perm,

06:48.720 --> 06:49.760
firework perm,

06:49.760 --> 06:51.640
Morgan perm, cushion perm,

06:51.640 --> 06:52.360
and texture perm.

06:53.040 --> 06:54.320
They all look like curls,

06:54.960 --> 06:55.840
but

06:56.159 --> 06:57.680
for each style, you have to get

06:57.880 --> 06:58.960
the rods,

06:59.159 --> 07:00.000
the perm solution,

07:00.320 --> 07:01.480
and the timing right.

07:02.520 --> 07:03.720
And it all comes down to hair type.

07:04.320 --> 07:05.400
Some hair can take

07:05.560 --> 07:06.800
certain perms, and some just can't.

07:07.400 --> 07:09.400
You can't perm it however you want.

07:20.760 --> 07:23.240
Auntie, that's magic.

07:23.640 --> 07:24.920
You're so good at this.

07:24.920 --> 07:26.320
He looks like a different person.

07:27.640 --> 07:28.200
Ye,

07:28.760 --> 07:30.200
let's try again.

07:31.280 --> 07:32.200
On who?

07:39.600 --> 07:40.480
I've got other plans later.

07:41.080 --> 07:41.760
You

07:41.840 --> 07:42.640
figure it out yourselves.

07:42.720 --> 07:43.440
- Lanfang?
- Auntie?

07:43.440 --> 07:44.159
Don't forget to sweep the floor.

07:44.159 --> 07:44.760
Auntie? Auntie?

07:44.760 --> 07:45.400
Bye.

07:48.560 --> 07:49.400
She's off to play mahjong again.

07:50.840 --> 07:51.880
Gone in a flash.

07:53.560 --> 07:54.840
So who do we practice on?

08:01.560 --> 08:02.640
How about me?

08:04.800 --> 08:05.360
You?

08:14.480 --> 08:15.800
The rods are in.

08:16.840 --> 08:17.400
Ye,

08:18.080 --> 08:18.960
you sure about this?

08:21.440 --> 08:21.920
Go ahead.

08:22.920 --> 08:23.720
You have to go back to school

08:23.720 --> 08:24.840
after the summer vacation.

08:26.160 --> 08:27.400
Then do it right.

08:27.680 --> 08:28.760
You've only got one shot.

08:29.760 --> 08:30.560
I'm worried

08:30.600 --> 08:32.159
I'll ruin your hair.

08:33.360 --> 08:33.919
It's okay.

08:34.400 --> 08:35.159
Hair

08:35.520 --> 08:36.559
will grow back.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.440
Then I'll put the solution on?

08:42.760 --> 08:43.159
Do it.

08:44.280 --> 08:45.080
Ye?

08:46.640 --> 08:47.160
Grandma?

08:47.200 --> 08:47.680
Grandma?

08:47.920 --> 08:50.560
How about I give you one more model

08:50.760 --> 08:51.400
to practice on?

08:57.440 --> 08:58.000
Ye,

08:58.680 --> 08:59.280
if

08:59.480 --> 09:01.640
my perm turns out well,

09:02.280 --> 09:03.280
take a photo

09:03.600 --> 09:05.000
of me tomorrow too.

09:05.680 --> 09:06.680
Sure.

09:07.280 --> 09:09.000
Then I'll have photos of beauties

09:09.000 --> 09:10.280
from every age group at Zhazhating.

09:11.560 --> 09:12.320
Great.

09:12.920 --> 09:14.000
When I'm gone,

09:14.560 --> 09:16.360
that photo can be my memorial portrait.

09:17.320 --> 09:17.880
Grandma,

09:18.800 --> 09:19.520
knock on wood.

09:20.000 --> 09:21.640
Don't say things like that.

09:23.960 --> 09:25.800
At my age, I've got

09:25.840 --> 09:27.320
one foot in the grave.

09:27.520 --> 09:29.320
I'm not afraid of death.

09:30.200 --> 09:30.720
What?

09:31.200 --> 09:32.600
You don't wanna take my pictures?

09:33.040 --> 09:33.520
Of course

09:33.920 --> 09:34.640
I do.

09:35.200 --> 09:35.720
And more than that.

09:35.720 --> 09:37.120
I'm putting you on the poster

09:37.320 --> 09:38.880
to bring in older customers.

09:40.720 --> 09:41.440
Maybe

09:42.280 --> 09:42.920
I shall have Nian

09:43.280 --> 09:44.800
dye my hair black then.

09:45.000 --> 09:46.280
It makes me look younger.

09:46.760 --> 09:47.760
You already look young.

09:47.760 --> 09:48.760
No need to dye it, Grandma.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.160
This is exactly the look we want.

10:07.960 --> 10:08.680
Nian,

10:08.880 --> 10:11.360
you're really good at this.

10:11.440 --> 10:12.920
It's all thanks to the guidance

10:13.120 --> 10:14.280
of Lanfang and Ye.

10:14.680 --> 10:15.360
No.

10:15.720 --> 10:16.320
Grandma,

10:16.440 --> 10:17.840
it really looks amazing.

10:18.040 --> 10:19.200
You should've done it long ago.

10:20.280 --> 10:21.520
Do I look

10:21.840 --> 10:23.560
at least ten years younger?

10:23.880 --> 10:25.680
You look like a young lady again.

10:27.600 --> 10:28.160
Nian,

10:28.320 --> 10:28.800
quick.

10:29.040 --> 10:29.920
Take out Ye's rollers too

10:29.920 --> 10:31.200
and see how it turned out.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.200
Okay, here we go.

11:12.480 --> 11:13.000
Ye,

11:13.200 --> 11:14.320
open your eyes.

11:14.360 --> 11:15.680
Open your eyes and check it out.

11:26.720 --> 11:27.880
We did it.

11:28.320 --> 11:29.400
This worked, right?

11:29.600 --> 11:30.440
- Grandma,
- Definitely.

11:30.440 --> 11:30.920
does it look good?

11:31.080 --> 11:32.560
It's pretty.

11:33.440 --> 11:34.000
Nian,

11:34.440 --> 11:36.600
you're a perm genius!

11:37.280 --> 11:38.920
My grandma used to say that too,

11:39.000 --> 11:40.080
but I never believed her.

11:40.840 --> 11:42.320
I still need more practice, though.

11:42.520 --> 11:43.920
It worked out mainly because your hair

11:44.160 --> 11:44.800
is thick and healthy.

11:45.400 --> 11:46.040
But Ye,

11:46.760 --> 11:49.080
this really suits you.

11:49.360 --> 11:50.080
I'm going

11:50.160 --> 11:51.640
to show Auntie right now

11:51.720 --> 11:53.000
and see if we pass.

11:53.040 --> 11:53.880
Okay.

12:25.000 --> 12:25.800
Does it look good?

12:28.280 --> 12:29.440
Your new hairstyle looks great.

12:33.200 --> 12:34.080
Like...

12:34.080 --> 12:35.400
Like that princess with red hair

12:35.440 --> 12:36.280
in the cartoon.

12:37.560 --> 12:38.320
Merida?

12:38.400 --> 12:38.880
Yeah.

12:41.360 --> 12:42.440
But my hair's black.

12:45.560 --> 12:46.920
Black looks better than red.

12:49.400 --> 12:50.280
It's prettier.

13:04.040 --> 13:04.720
Not bad, right?

13:05.200 --> 13:05.800
Grandma.

13:06.600 --> 13:07.200
Wu?

13:08.080 --> 13:09.000
- Come look.
- Wu, you're back.

13:09.320 --> 13:11.160
How's my new hairstyle?

13:11.920 --> 13:12.520
Chic.

13:13.000 --> 13:13.600
So chic.

13:14.480 --> 13:15.080
Auntie,

13:15.560 --> 13:16.720
look at my new hair.

13:18.320 --> 13:19.600
- You look stunning.
- Beautiful.

13:19.600 --> 13:20.840
It's lovely.

13:20.880 --> 13:22.560
So stylish.

13:23.040 --> 13:23.920
You look great.

13:24.000 --> 13:25.160
You and Nian

13:25.240 --> 13:26.360
did all this?

13:27.520 --> 13:29.360
You two are really

13:29.400 --> 13:30.400
impressive.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.520
You pulled off a style this tricky.

13:32.800 --> 13:33.760
Not bad at all.

13:34.040 --> 13:35.000
Someone even said

13:35.000 --> 13:36.120
I look like Merida.

13:36.800 --> 13:37.480
What?

13:38.160 --> 13:39.440
Marvellous.

13:39.640 --> 13:41.360
Who said such sweet things?

13:51.200 --> 13:53.160
Hair dye, 188 yuan.

13:53.440 --> 13:55.080
Perm, 288 yuan.

13:55.320 --> 13:58.040
Dye and perm package, 368 yuan.

13:59.760 --> 14:01.040
Isn't that too high?

14:01.400 --> 14:02.360
No one will come.

14:02.760 --> 14:04.280
I've already checked the prices

14:04.280 --> 14:05.120
at other salons in town.

14:05.480 --> 14:07.280
Their quality is

14:07.280 --> 14:07.920
about the same as ours,

14:07.920 --> 14:08.960
and they charge even more.

14:09.720 --> 14:10.320
I think

14:10.320 --> 14:11.840
customers are willing to

14:11.840 --> 14:13.160
pay for quality service,

14:13.320 --> 14:14.880
as long as it's within their

14:14.880 --> 14:15.520
budget.

14:16.920 --> 14:17.920
Besides, Auntie,

14:18.280 --> 14:19.840
if we start higher,

14:20.000 --> 14:20.840
we have room to

14:20.840 --> 14:21.720
lower prices later.

14:22.080 --> 14:22.680
Really?

14:24.760 --> 14:25.480
Alright,

14:25.880 --> 14:26.880
we'll do it your way.

14:29.280 --> 14:30.680
Summer special,

14:30.880 --> 14:32.000
exclusive member perks.

14:32.280 --> 14:34.440
We have memberships now?

14:34.640 --> 14:36.200
We got to make money.

14:36.520 --> 14:37.360
We can't sit around

14:37.480 --> 14:38.920
and hope good things happen.

14:39.960 --> 14:41.440
We're doing top-ups too?

14:41.480 --> 14:41.920
Right.

14:41.920 --> 14:44.440
Top up 288 yuan, 10% off.

14:44.440 --> 14:46.120
488 yuan, 20% off.

14:46.160 --> 14:47.200
688 yuan, 30% off.

14:47.840 --> 14:48.600
We used to charge

14:48.600 --> 14:49.760
15 yuan for a haircut.

14:50.120 --> 14:51.120
If we suddenly

14:51.480 --> 14:52.560
raise the price to 20 yuan,

14:53.120 --> 14:54.560
customers might

14:54.600 --> 14:55.280
stop coming.

14:55.440 --> 14:56.200
Exactly.

14:56.280 --> 14:57.760
So right now we

14:57.960 --> 14:59.600
need to put out

14:59.600 --> 15:00.640
these posters and flyers.

15:00.920 --> 15:01.920
In addition,

15:01.920 --> 15:02.880
we need word of mouth.

15:03.000 --> 15:03.520
We need to get

15:03.640 --> 15:05.480
new customers and regulars to sign up.

15:05.800 --> 15:06.760
Let them know once they

15:06.760 --> 15:07.520
get a membership,

15:07.720 --> 15:09.360
a haircut costs just over ten yuan.

15:09.640 --> 15:11.000
Stack that with the discounts,

15:11.280 --> 15:12.280
a haircut could cost

15:12.280 --> 15:13.160
less than ten yuan.

15:13.200 --> 15:14.560
That's cheap.

15:14.720 --> 15:16.040
We need to make them feel like

15:16.040 --> 15:17.560
they're getting a great deal.

15:17.840 --> 15:18.920
That's exactly the point

15:18.920 --> 15:19.560
of advertising.

15:19.600 --> 15:21.680
But we can't lose money.

15:22.160 --> 15:23.280
Don't worry, Auntie.

15:23.480 --> 15:25.320
We're still making money.

15:25.640 --> 15:26.800
When customers,

15:26.800 --> 15:27.320
look,

15:27.400 --> 15:28.200
put 288 yuan, 488 yuan,

15:28.200 --> 15:28.840
or 688 yuan

15:29.000 --> 15:29.800
on a card upfront,

15:29.800 --> 15:30.840
they'll keep coming back

15:31.200 --> 15:31.680
to use it, right?

15:31.880 --> 15:33.080
So we're locking in

15:33.320 --> 15:34.320
loyal customers

15:34.640 --> 15:35.880
and getting the cash upfront.

15:36.200 --> 15:38.280
We can get both returning customers

15:38.440 --> 15:39.440
and steady income.

15:39.840 --> 15:40.640
Makes sense.

15:40.640 --> 15:41.280
Lanfang?

15:42.000 --> 15:43.280
Coming.

15:44.200 --> 15:45.680
I wanna have a hair gloss

15:46.040 --> 15:46.800
and a perm.

15:47.080 --> 15:47.840
Sure thing.

15:47.840 --> 15:48.720
I want a perm too.

15:48.720 --> 15:49.480
No problem.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.200
Nian, you're up.

15:50.440 --> 15:51.120
One on each side.

15:51.640 --> 15:53.280
You can have the seats.

15:53.480 --> 15:54.080
Sit here.

15:54.160 --> 15:54.720
Aunties,

15:55.400 --> 15:57.720
here comes the marketing opportunity.

15:58.840 --> 15:59.840
Get them to sign up.

16:01.440 --> 16:02.160
Okay.

16:06.120 --> 16:06.720
We

16:07.320 --> 16:08.840
absolutely cannot run

16:08.880 --> 16:10.520
Xuan Island like a small salon.

16:10.960 --> 16:12.680
We need to grow the business

16:13.480 --> 16:14.400
and bring in more customers,

16:14.400 --> 16:16.120
so everyone in the area knows about us

16:16.200 --> 16:17.920
through word of mouth.

16:18.160 --> 16:19.560
And what sets us apart?

16:20.040 --> 16:21.000
Our skill.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.480
So please, everyone,

16:22.600 --> 16:24.480
spread the word.

16:24.560 --> 16:25.920
Let others know how good we are.

16:26.560 --> 16:28.120
[Even a pep talk?]

16:28.320 --> 16:28.960
But Ye,

16:29.480 --> 16:30.920
we've planned all this out,

16:31.080 --> 16:32.440
but what if nobody

16:32.440 --> 16:33.000
shows up?

16:33.280 --> 16:33.800
Right.

16:33.960 --> 16:35.520
That's exactly why we have to try.

16:35.760 --> 16:37.200
We have come this far and need to

16:37.200 --> 16:38.160
keep pushing.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.840
If problems come up, we deal with them.

16:40.120 --> 16:41.920
But we can't doubt ourselves

16:41.920 --> 16:43.120
before we've even started.

16:44.280 --> 16:44.680
Right.

16:46.800 --> 16:48.440
Ye's got vision.

16:49.120 --> 16:50.160
She's got a business mind.

16:50.600 --> 16:51.640
We've been doing this

16:51.640 --> 16:52.680
half our lives,

16:53.040 --> 16:54.280
and this young girl

16:54.360 --> 16:55.120
plans better than we do.

16:55.320 --> 16:55.880
Exactly.

16:56.520 --> 16:57.000
Yes.

16:57.320 --> 16:59.360
Since you got it all figured out,

16:59.640 --> 17:00.280
I trust you.

17:00.560 --> 17:01.000
Trust me.

17:01.160 --> 17:01.600
We do.

17:01.680 --> 17:02.160
Trust me.

17:02.280 --> 17:02.960
- Yes.
- We trust you.

17:03.120 --> 17:03.560
Ye,

17:04.040 --> 17:05.400
how do you know all this?

17:05.560 --> 17:06.440
Where did you

17:06.560 --> 17:07.599
pick it up?

17:07.599 --> 17:08.319
Yeah.

17:08.440 --> 17:10.720
My dad used to tell me

17:10.720 --> 17:12.280
how he ran his business.

17:12.319 --> 17:12.880
Never thought

17:12.960 --> 17:14.480
it'd come in handy one day.

17:14.720 --> 17:16.079
I've put it all to use for Xuan Island.

17:16.839 --> 17:17.359
Yeah,

17:17.640 --> 17:18.400
my brother-in-law

17:18.400 --> 17:20.079
is a big businessman.

17:20.359 --> 17:21.359
What do they say?

17:21.400 --> 17:23.720
Like father, like daughter.

17:24.000 --> 17:26.200
The apple doesn't fall far from the tree.

17:27.880 --> 17:29.160
Oh, stop it.

17:29.160 --> 17:31.720
She just picked these from her dad.

17:31.880 --> 17:32.400
So,

17:32.680 --> 17:33.840
what else do we need to get ready?

17:34.280 --> 17:34.680
Yeah.

17:34.840 --> 17:37.440
Everything's ready except the materials.

17:37.880 --> 17:38.840
So tomorrow,

17:38.920 --> 17:40.200
everyone must

17:40.360 --> 17:41.720
go all out.

17:41.800 --> 17:42.400
Go all out.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.640
Go all out! Go all out!

17:44.760 --> 17:45.920
Go all out!

17:47.680 --> 17:48.480
Perfect.

17:49.880 --> 17:50.800
Am I almost done?

17:50.800 --> 17:52.200
Your curls look gorgeous.

17:52.840 --> 17:53.880
Wonder how mine turned out.

17:53.880 --> 17:54.840
Yours must look great too.

17:54.920 --> 17:55.360
Really?

17:55.360 --> 17:55.880
Trust me.

17:55.880 --> 17:56.920
- Is it overdone?
- I love the color.

17:56.960 --> 17:57.440
No, it's fine.

17:57.480 --> 17:58.120
Looking your best starts

17:58.160 --> 17:59.120
with a great hairstyle.

17:59.240 --> 18:00.440
- Is it beautiful?
- Yeah, very pretty.

18:05.920 --> 18:06.560
Later,

18:06.680 --> 18:07.800
I'll count down three two one.

18:08.120 --> 18:09.440
Just walk naturally toward me.

18:09.440 --> 18:10.280
Quanya'll catch it candid.

18:10.480 --> 18:10.920
Got it.

18:10.920 --> 18:11.440
Okay.

18:11.840 --> 18:13.400
Three, two, one, walk.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.400
Wait, wait. Stop, stop, stop.

18:16.640 --> 18:18.400
No, you're all walking wrong.

18:19.000 --> 18:19.760
- Really?
- We did?

18:20.080 --> 18:20.560
Yes, you did.

18:20.560 --> 18:21.280
Alright.

18:21.280 --> 18:22.080
Work out how you walk first.

18:22.360 --> 18:23.600
Let's walk in sync.

18:23.640 --> 18:24.600
Left foot first, right?

18:24.600 --> 18:25.160
Got it, okay.

18:25.280 --> 18:25.720
Right.

18:25.840 --> 18:26.360
Yeah, left.

18:26.360 --> 18:26.840
Okay, ready?

18:27.280 --> 18:28.840
Three, two, one, walk.

18:30.040 --> 18:31.720
Looking good. A little more natural.

18:32.000 --> 18:33.240
Walk like you own the place.

18:33.240 --> 18:34.600
Good, nice.

18:35.160 --> 18:35.880
Slightly bigger steps.

18:37.000 --> 18:37.640
Mom?

18:38.280 --> 18:39.280
Kyle?

18:39.480 --> 18:40.160
Mom,

18:40.840 --> 18:42.040
what happened to you?

18:42.400 --> 18:43.280
Don't call me mom.

18:43.560 --> 18:44.200
Call me sis.

18:44.680 --> 18:46.640
This... Mom, no, sis.

18:47.760 --> 18:49.360
Call me Cici.

18:49.520 --> 18:50.400
You brat,

18:50.400 --> 18:51.040
I changed my hair

18:51.040 --> 18:52.360
last night,

18:52.360 --> 18:53.440
and you didn't even notice?

18:54.800 --> 18:55.880
Do I look good today?

18:56.160 --> 18:56.720
These curls.

18:56.840 --> 18:57.840
Don't touch!

18:57.840 --> 18:58.680
Ladies, ladies,

18:58.680 --> 18:59.680
we're losing the light.

18:59.800 --> 19:00.440
Don't move, don't move.

19:00.640 --> 19:01.440
Quick, quick.

19:02.520 --> 19:03.440
Kim Hee-sun?

19:04.200 --> 19:05.480
Lin Chiling?

19:07.560 --> 19:08.480
Lydia Shum?

19:09.080 --> 19:10.040
Stop it.

19:10.440 --> 19:11.160
Get lost.

19:11.160 --> 19:12.200
Just go back and cook.

19:12.280 --> 19:13.040
Go back now.

19:13.600 --> 19:15.000
We're losing the light.

19:15.040 --> 19:16.200
- Come on.
- Here we go.

19:16.760 --> 19:17.480
Let's get this right.

19:17.560 --> 19:19.480
Ready? Three, two, one, walk.

19:20.880 --> 19:21.600
Nice.

19:22.000 --> 19:22.520
You look pretty.

19:22.760 --> 19:23.440
Attitude.

19:23.760 --> 19:25.200
Give me attitude. I'm fabulous.

19:25.480 --> 19:27.360
I'm gorgeous. Touch your hair.

19:27.720 --> 19:29.000
Show off those curls.

19:29.280 --> 19:30.360
These curls are stunning.

19:30.440 --> 19:31.480
They look so much younger.

19:32.400 --> 19:34.200
My mom made me call her sis.

19:34.640 --> 19:36.000
Does that mean dad has to call me

19:37.160 --> 19:37.800
bro?

19:40.520 --> 19:41.200
What's wrong with you?

19:43.320 --> 19:44.440
Grandma, have some coffee.

19:44.480 --> 19:45.080
I'm taking a picture.

19:45.360 --> 19:46.000
Don't mind us.

19:46.000 --> 19:47.280
Just keep talking.

20:16.880 --> 20:17.600
Okay, look at the camera.

20:17.720 --> 20:18.520
Look at you.

20:19.200 --> 20:21.560
Three, two, one.

20:22.280 --> 20:22.880
One more.

20:23.040 --> 20:23.720
Switch it up.

20:24.560 --> 20:25.280
Come on.

20:25.800 --> 20:27.120
Relax. Just relax.

20:27.280 --> 20:29.280
Cheese.

20:34.360 --> 20:35.680
So pretty.

20:36.600 --> 20:38.200
This one looks so cool.

20:38.200 --> 20:38.840
Mr. Liu,

20:39.160 --> 20:40.520
have you got the RAM stick?

20:41.360 --> 20:41.960
[Yes.]

20:43.040 --> 20:44.680
And thanks for the camera.

20:44.960 --> 20:46.280
I'll bring it back tonight.

20:46.560 --> 20:48.040
[Sure. No problem.]

20:52.800 --> 20:53.960
Oh my God.

20:56.800 --> 20:57.720
That's amazing.

20:57.840 --> 20:58.320
Actually, wait.

20:58.320 --> 20:59.360
How about tomorrow?

20:59.560 --> 21:00.960
I'll drop it off tomorrow morning,

21:00.960 --> 21:01.440
Okay?

21:01.760 --> 21:02.400
[No problem.]

21:02.800 --> 21:03.400
Thanks.

21:04.440 --> 21:04.920
Bye.

21:05.960 --> 21:06.760
Ladies,

21:06.840 --> 21:07.920
watermelon's here.

21:08.560 --> 21:09.920
- Come on.
- Have some watermelon.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.960
Tong, nicely cut.

21:11.960 --> 21:12.400
Come on, guys.

21:12.400 --> 21:13.040
So thoughtful.

21:13.040 --> 21:13.760
Come have some.

21:14.000 --> 21:14.640
Here, one slice each.

21:14.640 --> 21:16.040
Grandma, try some watermelon.

21:16.080 --> 21:16.600
Ye.

21:30.840 --> 21:31.360
For me?

21:31.800 --> 21:32.560
It's refreshing.

21:32.960 --> 21:33.480
Thanks.

21:34.960 --> 21:36.920
Quanya takes great pictures.

21:36.920 --> 21:37.680
They look straight out of a magazine.

21:37.680 --> 21:38.600
How did you know he could do that?

21:39.200 --> 21:40.400
I've known him for years.

21:40.520 --> 21:41.280
Of course I knew.

21:43.120 --> 21:44.520
Everyone's way more

21:44.520 --> 21:46.000
into this than I expected.

21:46.320 --> 21:47.200
Especially Auntie.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.000
She's thrown herself into it.

21:50.480 --> 21:51.480
Zhazhating hasn't

21:51.480 --> 21:52.480
been this lively in a long time.

21:55.840 --> 21:56.520
Well,

21:57.480 --> 21:58.800
whether or not Xuan Island's

21:58.800 --> 21:59.720
business picks up,

21:59.840 --> 22:01.720
at least today everyone's having fun

22:01.720 --> 22:02.400
together.

22:06.720 --> 22:07.960
Melon cheers.

22:11.200 --> 22:12.280
Come on, look over here.

22:13.640 --> 22:14.280
One more.

22:17.280 --> 22:18.560
Try a different pose. One more shot.

22:30.000 --> 22:31.360
I told you you had a gift.

22:31.880 --> 22:32.720
These are really good.

22:34.320 --> 22:35.440
Wu, look at this one.

22:36.160 --> 22:37.000
It's beautiful.

22:39.000 --> 22:39.960
It's good because it looks natural.

22:40.280 --> 22:41.680
You can feel the vibe.

22:43.080 --> 22:44.000
You did great too.

22:45.720 --> 22:46.560
You should

22:46.800 --> 22:48.440
put this one on the poster too.

22:49.000 --> 22:49.720
It'll bring in customers.

22:53.160 --> 22:53.720
No problem.

22:57.440 --> 22:58.800
No rush to return the camera, right?

22:59.560 --> 23:01.200
Can I take a few more?

23:01.880 --> 23:02.400
No rush.

23:02.720 --> 23:03.440
Take as many as you want.

23:07.120 --> 23:08.360
Okay, everybody, look this way again.

23:08.360 --> 23:09.040
One more round.

23:09.640 --> 23:10.520
A few more shots.

23:11.200 --> 23:12.720
Three, two, one,

23:13.120 --> 23:14.080
cheese.

23:14.200 --> 23:15.280
Cheese.

23:38.400 --> 23:38.960
Liu Nian!

23:39.600 --> 23:40.600
- Wu?
- I've sent your pay.

23:40.720 --> 23:41.560
You can check it out.

23:41.640 --> 23:42.640
Wu, you sent me an extra 500 yuan.

23:43.280 --> 23:43.960
A little bonus.

23:44.360 --> 23:45.280
The salon's been busy lately,

23:45.480 --> 23:46.440
and you've been learning how to do perms.

23:46.840 --> 23:47.440
You've worked hard.

23:47.800 --> 23:49.040
But you work hard for the money too.

23:49.280 --> 23:50.720
I'm an assistant anyway.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.200
It's what I'm supposed to do.

23:52.760 --> 23:53.440
Besides,

23:53.560 --> 23:54.680
you and Lanfang have done so much for me.

23:55.120 --> 23:55.920
That's a different thing.

23:56.160 --> 23:56.680
Keep the money.

23:58.760 --> 23:59.360
Wu,

23:59.960 --> 24:00.480
how about this?

24:00.800 --> 24:01.400
I'll use the 500 yuan

24:01.720 --> 24:03.000
to treat everyone to dinner.

24:03.360 --> 24:04.480
No way I'm letting you pay.

24:04.760 --> 24:05.600
Once we're done here,

24:06.120 --> 24:07.040
I'll get everyone together for dinner.

24:07.360 --> 24:07.880
My treat.

24:08.480 --> 24:08.960
Okay.

24:19.280 --> 24:20.440
Cheers.

24:24.600 --> 24:25.480
On behalf of Xuan Island,

24:26.200 --> 24:26.720
thank you.

24:27.560 --> 24:28.280
Thank me?

24:29.160 --> 24:30.000
Then I should thank you

24:30.000 --> 24:30.920
for believing in me.

24:34.640 --> 24:35.320
Ye,

24:36.520 --> 24:37.160
if it weren't for you,

24:37.640 --> 24:38.360
I never would've

24:38.360 --> 24:39.200
known I was capable.

24:39.480 --> 24:40.520
Thanks for encouraging me.

24:41.160 --> 24:41.720
A toast to you.

24:42.160 --> 24:43.240
No need to thank me.

24:43.280 --> 24:44.040
You're amazing.

24:44.440 --> 24:44.960
Ye,

24:45.640 --> 24:46.920
if you ever need anything,

24:46.920 --> 24:47.840
just say the word.

24:48.080 --> 24:48.920
In Zhazhating,

24:49.000 --> 24:50.440
Wu's got my back, and I've got yours.

24:51.960 --> 24:52.440
Okay.

24:52.760 --> 24:53.800
First, I owe you guys an apology.

24:53.920 --> 24:55.560
I wasn't exactly nice to you before.

24:56.440 --> 24:56.880
It's fine.

24:56.880 --> 24:58.760
Don't mind it.

25:00.120 --> 25:01.040
I know how boring

25:01.680 --> 25:03.080
our summer was before.

25:03.120 --> 25:04.000
you came.

25:04.200 --> 25:05.400
You made things a lot more fun.

25:05.640 --> 25:06.200
This one's for you.

25:06.560 --> 25:07.000
Okay.

25:09.360 --> 25:10.080
Because of you,

25:10.360 --> 25:11.760
Wu got me a DSLR.

25:12.080 --> 25:12.880
I realize I'm really

25:12.880 --> 25:13.680
into portraits.

25:14.280 --> 25:15.440
After Han comes back from Hainan...

25:18.680 --> 25:19.560
Just drink it.

25:26.120 --> 25:27.600
You're all thanking me,

25:28.320 --> 25:29.120
but honestly,

25:29.440 --> 25:30.560
when I first got here,

25:30.840 --> 25:32.120
I really hated this place.

25:32.480 --> 25:33.800
And I really hated you.

25:35.960 --> 25:36.720
But

25:37.400 --> 25:38.480
thinking about it now,

25:38.720 --> 25:39.760
if it weren't for you,

25:40.280 --> 25:41.360
I'd probably

25:41.360 --> 25:42.880
be wandering the streets

25:43.320 --> 25:44.080
of Beijing.

25:46.680 --> 25:47.280
So

25:48.320 --> 25:49.440
thanks, Wu,

25:50.080 --> 25:50.880
you're a good man.

25:55.080 --> 25:56.200
Is that a praise?

25:57.520 --> 25:58.040
Cheers.

25:58.200 --> 25:58.680
Cheers.

26:02.000 --> 26:03.280
Las, toast to

26:03.880 --> 26:05.680
Xuan Island's

26:06.000 --> 26:07.960
first step forward.

26:08.200 --> 26:08.640
Cheers.

26:08.760 --> 26:11.640
- Great, cheers.
- Cheers.

26:17.000 --> 26:17.600
All right, dig in.

26:17.800 --> 26:18.440
Eat up, guys.

26:18.960 --> 26:19.640
Have some shrimp.

26:22.440 --> 26:22.880
Hello?

26:26.080 --> 26:27.440
Got it. I'll be right there.

26:30.280 --> 26:30.840
Where are you going?

26:31.240 --> 26:32.520
Mrs. Zhou's WiFi is down.

26:32.520 --> 26:33.280
Gotta go fix it.

26:33.840 --> 26:34.880
Can't it wait till tomorrow?

26:35.040 --> 26:36.160
Her kid has online class

26:36.280 --> 26:36.800
and needs it now.

26:37.200 --> 26:37.760
You guys eat first.

26:37.800 --> 26:38.520
I'll be back in a bit.

26:40.160 --> 26:41.640
- Bye.
- Bye.

26:41.880 --> 26:42.680
I'll be right back.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.200
Okay.

26:44.800 --> 26:45.720
Ye, go ahead and eat.

26:46.200 --> 26:47.200
Wu's always getting

26:47.480 --> 26:48.640
called away in the middle

26:48.720 --> 26:49.360
of a meal.

26:49.840 --> 26:50.600
Come on.

26:50.640 --> 26:51.280
Let's eat.

26:51.280 --> 26:51.760
Don't worry about him.

26:51.760 --> 26:52.360
Go on, eat.

26:52.680 --> 26:53.240
Come on.

26:54.280 --> 26:55.120
Let's have another drink.

26:55.320 --> 26:56.160
- Come on.
- Let's drink.

26:56.160 --> 26:56.680
Cheers.

26:56.920 --> 26:57.600
Cheers.

26:57.680 --> 26:58.320
Cheers.

27:21.000 --> 27:22.160
How is she not tired?

27:23.720 --> 27:25.360
Her mind's probably a mess

27:26.160 --> 27:27.280
but her legs have other plans.

27:28.320 --> 27:29.200
Big leap.

27:29.920 --> 27:31.000
Two big leaps.

27:45.400 --> 27:46.120
What's going on?

27:48.520 --> 27:49.400
I leave for a while

27:49.400 --> 27:50.280
and you've drunk this much?

27:50.840 --> 27:51.520
Where are they?

27:52.280 --> 27:53.320
No idea.

27:54.320 --> 27:55.120
Where's Ye?

27:57.200 --> 27:57.800
Over there.

27:58.920 --> 28:00.000
Beach swan.

28:01.400 --> 28:02.080
Beautiful.

28:04.960 --> 28:05.840
This way. Yes.

28:05.840 --> 28:06.440
Over here, over here.

28:07.160 --> 28:07.760
Next,

28:10.600 --> 28:11.240
take a bow.

28:11.720 --> 28:12.400
Thank you.

28:13.720 --> 28:14.520
What's she doing?

28:16.640 --> 28:17.280
Wu.

28:17.960 --> 28:20.200
I can do a backflip too.

28:20.840 --> 28:21.880
Why didn't you two stop her?

28:22.360 --> 28:23.920
We tried.

28:24.760 --> 28:25.680
She was unstoppable.

28:25.800 --> 28:27.000
At least keep an eye on her.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.280
Watch this.

28:29.360 --> 28:30.600
We did our best.

28:33.600 --> 28:34.800
Alright, alright, you can go.

28:35.600 --> 28:36.280
Get those two home.

28:36.280 --> 28:37.000
They're passed out.

28:37.120 --> 28:37.560
Wait.

28:37.640 --> 28:38.760
You missed two earlier acts.

28:38.760 --> 28:39.320
Wanna see?

28:39.400 --> 28:40.040
Get lost.

28:40.200 --> 28:40.720
I'm serious.

28:41.280 --> 28:41.720
Go.

28:48.080 --> 28:49.080
Send those two home.

28:49.120 --> 28:49.680
Okay.

28:50.360 --> 28:51.160
I can do

28:51.920 --> 28:52.680
a backflip.

28:53.600 --> 28:55.000
Spin.

28:55.560 --> 28:56.160
Then,

28:58.280 --> 29:00.000
I can do this, see?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.200
And this.

29:06.080 --> 29:06.960
What else have you got?

29:09.360 --> 29:10.440
Wu.

29:14.480 --> 29:15.480
Wu.

29:21.880 --> 29:22.400
Quick.

29:22.800 --> 29:23.400
Come down.

29:25.920 --> 29:27.040
Come on.

29:29.240 --> 29:30.880
Come down here.

29:31.560 --> 29:32.920
Fine, I'm coming down.

29:36.240 --> 29:36.800
This way.

29:39.440 --> 29:40.400
Easy. Easy.

29:43.600 --> 29:44.840
Wu,

29:45.040 --> 29:46.520
do you like my dancing?

29:48.000 --> 29:48.480
Yes.

29:49.200 --> 29:50.800
Are we

29:51.160 --> 29:52.320
family now?

29:52.680 --> 29:53.160
Of course.

29:53.480 --> 29:54.040
Then,

29:54.520 --> 29:55.880
family should be honest

29:55.920 --> 29:57.000
with each other, right?

29:57.920 --> 29:58.360
Yes.

29:59.360 --> 30:01.160
Honestly, I want

30:01.720 --> 30:03.080
Xuan Island to make

30:03.120 --> 30:04.920
loads of money.

30:05.840 --> 30:06.960
And when it does,

30:08.400 --> 30:09.080
I'll

30:09.720 --> 30:10.640
support you.

30:11.720 --> 30:12.360
Really.

30:12.880 --> 30:13.880
- I'll buy you
- Alright.

30:13.960 --> 30:15.000
a mansion.

30:15.560 --> 30:17.760
And a big, big bed.

30:17.760 --> 30:18.440
Easy there.

30:18.880 --> 30:19.560
I mean it.

30:20.560 --> 30:21.360
I really mean it.

30:21.360 --> 30:22.560
I'll keep my word.

30:22.960 --> 30:23.440
Okay,

30:23.840 --> 30:24.920
but I don't really mind.

30:26.560 --> 30:27.480
No,

30:29.200 --> 30:30.880
you can't think that way.

30:32.720 --> 30:33.280
Why not?

30:34.480 --> 30:36.680
Because you've had it so hard.

30:38.240 --> 30:38.760
What?

30:40.800 --> 30:41.720
I said,

30:48.040 --> 30:49.880
you've had it so hard.

30:51.920 --> 30:53.280
It hurts me to see that.

31:14.680 --> 31:15.520
It hurts you?

31:19.320 --> 31:21.000
Once Xuan Island

31:21.080 --> 31:22.880
makes lots of money,

31:24.880 --> 31:25.920
you won't have to

31:27.040 --> 31:30.160
work yourself so hard, right?

31:45.320 --> 31:47.040
Let me show you something.

31:47.760 --> 31:48.480
Wait.

31:55.200 --> 31:57.800
You know Monkey King's born from a rock?

31:58.200 --> 31:58.680
Like this.

32:12.120 --> 32:12.600
Jackpot!

32:13.040 --> 32:13.720
What?

32:14.960 --> 32:15.760
We hit jackpot!

32:16.880 --> 32:17.480
Rich.

32:18.120 --> 32:18.960
Wu,

32:19.760 --> 32:20.280
we'll be rich.

32:21.000 --> 32:21.680
Jade.

32:22.760 --> 32:23.640
Imperial jade.

32:24.320 --> 32:26.200
We're gonna be rich, Wu.

32:27.280 --> 32:28.040
Look.

32:28.400 --> 32:28.920
Gosh.

32:29.400 --> 32:30.200
That really

32:30.680 --> 32:31.720
- is imperial jade.
- See?

32:32.000 --> 32:32.800
Once we

32:33.600 --> 32:34.520
sell it,

32:35.040 --> 32:37.160
we can live in a huge villa.

32:38.640 --> 32:39.160
I...

32:39.600 --> 32:41.280
I'm going to buy you a villa.

32:41.720 --> 32:42.440
Wait.

32:44.400 --> 32:46.400
I'll go buy you a villa.

32:46.640 --> 32:47.400
Hold on. What,

32:47.680 --> 32:48.480
are you taking a boat?

32:48.720 --> 32:49.280
Yeah.

32:49.400 --> 32:51.000
Gotta sail out.

32:51.360 --> 32:52.560
It's on the other side.

32:53.080 --> 32:53.560
Go,

32:54.160 --> 32:54.760
Captain.

32:55.160 --> 32:55.600
Hurry.

32:55.880 --> 32:56.400
Set sail.

32:56.720 --> 32:57.280
Captain?

32:58.280 --> 32:59.560
We have to go now.

32:59.960 --> 33:00.480
All right.

33:01.040 --> 33:02.920
I'm setting sail.

33:03.320 --> 33:03.800
Go.

33:04.440 --> 33:05.080
Let's go.

33:10.320 --> 33:12.280
Jack, Jack, Jack.

33:14.360 --> 33:16.680
You jump, I jump.

33:20.280 --> 33:20.800
Okay,

33:21.280 --> 33:21.920
Rose.

33:25.800 --> 33:26.440
Jack.

33:28.080 --> 33:29.200
Jack!

33:30.280 --> 33:30.920
Rose?

33:31.360 --> 33:32.040
Jack?

33:32.200 --> 33:32.800
Rose!

33:33.200 --> 33:33.760
Jack!

33:34.160 --> 33:34.760
Rose!

33:37.600 --> 33:39.200
Go, go, go!

33:51.520 --> 33:52.360
Wu,

33:54.200 --> 33:55.120
your place,

33:56.400 --> 33:58.720
I really, really love it.

34:00.360 --> 34:01.640
It's so nice.

34:02.800 --> 34:04.280
Nice room too.

34:05.480 --> 34:06.680
But there's

34:07.960 --> 34:09.920
no wardrobe.

34:11.679 --> 34:14.159
No wardrobe for clothes.

34:16.280 --> 34:18.600
And it's so hot in here.

34:19.440 --> 34:21.480
And so many mosquitoes.

34:22.880 --> 34:24.040
It's so hot.

34:26.639 --> 34:28.400
- Hot?
- No wardrobe.

34:28.639 --> 34:29.679
I'll turn on the AC.

34:31.199 --> 34:33.159
I want a wardrobe.

34:33.920 --> 34:34.960
A wardrobe?

34:36.320 --> 34:37.400
I'll figure something out.

34:39.639 --> 34:40.360
I need

34:41.000 --> 34:41.760
- Anything else?
- a really,

34:42.639 --> 34:44.440
really big wardrobe.

36:04.960 --> 36:06.600
What are you doing so early?

36:07.360 --> 36:08.400
Early?

36:08.800 --> 36:09.720
Look at the time.

36:10.160 --> 36:11.480
It's the afternoon, Ye.

36:12.120 --> 36:12.760
It's 1:00 PM.

36:12.880 --> 36:14.040
You didn't wake me up.

36:14.120 --> 36:14.640
I tried.

36:15.480 --> 36:16.080
You were out cold.

36:16.920 --> 36:17.960
Were you drunk last night?

36:18.880 --> 36:20.080
I was out the second I hit the bed.

36:23.280 --> 36:24.080
Why did you laugh?

36:25.920 --> 36:26.560
You don't remember?

36:32.920 --> 36:33.800
Remember what?

36:35.320 --> 36:35.920
Never mind.

36:36.280 --> 36:36.880
Nothing.

36:37.200 --> 36:37.800
Better that you don't.

36:40.760 --> 36:41.600
What's going on?

36:42.040 --> 36:43.080
It's so hot.

36:43.720 --> 36:45.080
Let's go get popsicles.

36:45.640 --> 36:46.040
Let's go.

36:46.080 --> 36:46.880
What do you want, Ye?

36:47.200 --> 36:47.720
Nothing.

36:47.960 --> 36:49.160
I'll just pick one for you.

36:56.520 --> 36:57.480
Are you hiding something

36:57.480 --> 36:58.160
from me?

37:00.520 --> 37:00.920
Yes.

37:01.680 --> 37:02.360
What is it?

37:03.280 --> 37:03.840
You wanna know?

37:06.280 --> 37:06.960
What happened?

37:06.960 --> 37:08.080
What did I do last night?

37:08.640 --> 37:09.400
You really wanna know?

37:11.040 --> 37:12.080
Just tell me.

37:17.120 --> 37:18.120
Last night...

37:43.920 --> 37:44.600
You feel sick?

37:50.880 --> 37:51.720
I just realized

37:53.480 --> 37:54.560
you have

37:56.760 --> 37:57.960
one great quality.

38:01.880 --> 38:02.600
What quality?

38:04.080 --> 38:04.800
Wanna know?

38:13.840 --> 38:15.800
You've got a nice butt.

38:24.160 --> 38:25.320
Really nice.

38:39.320 --> 38:40.480
I said you

38:41.280 --> 38:42.160
had a nice butt?

38:43.840 --> 38:44.720
I'm flattered.

38:46.280 --> 38:47.480
Oh, no, no.

38:47.480 --> 38:48.320
My God.

38:48.320 --> 38:49.120
Somebody save me!

38:49.160 --> 38:50.800
What happened? What's going on, Ye?

38:54.440 --> 38:55.200
What's wrong with her?

38:55.560 --> 38:56.440
Probably did something

38:56.440 --> 38:57.360
she shouldn't have.

38:58.040 --> 38:58.920
Nonsense.

38:58.920 --> 39:00.160
She's a good girl.

39:00.160 --> 39:01.160
What could she

39:01.160 --> 39:02.600
possibly have done?

39:03.640 --> 39:04.480
You have no idea.

39:05.000 --> 39:05.920
She's got a side

39:06.560 --> 39:07.760
no one knows about.

39:08.160 --> 39:09.080
I just found out.

39:13.280 --> 39:14.640
The snow fungus soup

39:14.640 --> 39:15.280
is almost ready.

39:15.320 --> 39:15.920
Bring her

39:15.920 --> 39:16.640
a bowl later.

39:16.960 --> 39:17.440
No.

39:17.680 --> 39:18.280
You go.

39:18.760 --> 39:19.920
Why?

39:20.440 --> 39:21.400
She probably can't face me

39:22.080 --> 39:22.960
for the next few days.

39:25.280 --> 39:26.160
Can't face you?

39:38.800 --> 39:39.440
Where's Ye?

39:40.320 --> 39:40.800
She left.

39:41.520 --> 39:42.400
What about the popsicle?

39:42.520 --> 39:43.240
You've worked hard.

39:43.520 --> 39:44.280
You can have two.

39:44.840 --> 39:45.280
All right.

39:46.360 --> 39:47.560
What did you two do

39:47.960 --> 39:48.560
last night?

39:48.880 --> 39:49.600
None of your business.

40:05.880 --> 40:06.440
Here you go.

40:07.040 --> 40:08.160
Everything you asked for.

40:08.440 --> 40:10.320
That'll be 220 yuan.

40:11.640 --> 40:12.960
Could you give me a discount

40:13.640 --> 40:15.280
This is already the lowest.

40:16.880 --> 40:18.080
That young man,

40:18.720 --> 40:19.960
Xing Wu,

40:20.280 --> 40:21.160
you know him?

40:21.400 --> 40:22.400
He's my cousin.

40:22.600 --> 40:23.960
Your cousin?

40:25.880 --> 40:27.120
Alright then, I'll give you 20% off.

40:28.080 --> 40:29.560
176 yuan.

40:29.920 --> 40:30.640
Really?

40:31.480 --> 40:33.200
Then I owe him one.

40:34.040 --> 40:34.960
Not really.

40:35.160 --> 40:37.200
He's always fixing things for me,

40:38.000 --> 40:39.080
so giving you a discount

40:39.200 --> 40:39.960
is the least I can do.

40:40.720 --> 40:41.920
Whenever

40:42.200 --> 40:43.200
anything breaks in town,

40:43.320 --> 40:44.200
people go to him.

40:44.440 --> 40:45.360
Everyone knows him.

40:46.600 --> 40:47.480
QR code's right there.

40:47.520 --> 40:48.000
Got it.

41:05.720 --> 41:07.120
[Thanks to you, my celebrity cousin,]

41:07.280 --> 41:08.520
[the print shop owner gave me 20% off.]

41:36.320 --> 41:37.120
Did Ye make this?

41:40.160 --> 41:40.760
Wu,

41:41.080 --> 41:42.480
that neck pillow

41:42.680 --> 41:43.600
is hers too, right?

41:49.280 --> 41:50.440
Xuan Island's gonna be a hit.

41:51.000 --> 41:52.280
With poster this nice,

41:52.720 --> 41:54.120
business has to pick up.

41:59.120 --> 41:59.640
Oh,

42:00.320 --> 42:01.440
I have some good news.

42:02.720 --> 42:03.320
What is it?

42:03.880 --> 42:04.800
Han's business trip is over.

42:05.040 --> 42:05.800
She's coming back today.

42:06.720 --> 42:07.280
Really?

42:07.800 --> 42:08.680
She didn't tell me.

42:10.280 --> 42:10.760
Maybe

42:10.880 --> 42:12.080
she wanted to give you a surprise.

42:15.960 --> 42:17.200
Did I spoil it?

42:17.920 --> 42:19.400
Just pretend you didn't know.

42:20.400 --> 42:20.800
Okay.

43:02.480 --> 43:04.440
Hop in. I'll give you a ride.

43:05.840 --> 43:06.560
Where are you going?

43:06.840 --> 43:07.520
Zhazhating.

43:08.680 --> 43:09.440
Come on, get in.

43:09.440 --> 43:10.680
Don't worry, I'm not a bad guy.

43:10.840 --> 43:11.720
I'm not charging you either.

43:15.640 --> 43:16.160
Okay.

43:22.080 --> 43:23.360
Too much stuff in the back.

43:23.480 --> 43:24.320
You have to sit up front.

43:24.800 --> 43:25.680
Okay. Thanks.

43:26.240 --> 43:27.640
Here's a tissue. Dry your hair.

43:30.360 --> 43:31.040
Hainan?

43:32.000 --> 43:32.440
Yeah.

43:32.560 --> 43:33.960
I just got back from a business trip there.
